    {
      "id": "msg_0944_SC04_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, is that a Pokédex?\n",
        "You must be helping Professor Rowan?\r",
        "What’s your name?\r",
        "...\r",
        "OK, hello, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "I’ll be sure to remember that name!\r",
        "My name is Cynthia.\n",
        "I’m a Trainer just like you.\r",
        "I’ve been studying Pokémon mythology\n",
        "lately, just out of curiosity.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0944_SC04_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Here in Eterna City, there is a\n",
        "statue of an ancient Pokémon.\r",
        "According to myth, it was an\n",
        "extremely powerful Pokémon.\r",
        "Who knows? You may encounter\n",
        "something like it while you’re\\ftraveling with your Pokédex.\r",
        "Try using this.\n",
        "It should help you on your way.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0944_SC04_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: Remember, the hidden move\n",
        "Cut can be used in the field.\r",
        "It will let you go places that were\n",
        "previously inaccessible to you.\r",
        "That’s important for filling up your\n",
        "Pokédex, right?\r",
        "Then luck be with you, young Trainer!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0944_SC04_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey! You there, kid!\n",
        "Stay away from that Pokémon statue!\r",
        "Team Galactic is conducting an\n",
        "official investigation here!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0944_SC04_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, you! Yeah, you, Trainer!\r",
        "Errr...\n",
        "It’s OK. Never mind. You look tough.\r",
        "I won’t take... Um, I’ll just let you\n",
        "keep your Pokémon. Carry on!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0944_SC04_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Have you seen our building?\r",
        "Team Galactic is so stinking rich\n",
        "that we can have one built instantly!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0944_SC04_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Since that Team Galactic building went\n",
        "up, the city’s atmosphere has gotten\\fall creepy and tense.\r",
        "I don’t know what those people are\n",
        "doing up in that place..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0944_SC04_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "With Team Galactic gone, what’s going\n",
        "to happen to their building?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0944_SC04_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "My friend said Team Galactic took his\n",
        "favorite Pokémon away.\r",
        "I don’t think he’s telling the truth.\n",
        "Team Galactic looks so cool.\\fThey don’t look like common thugs."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0944_SC04_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you use Bike stands?\r",
        "It looks so cool to hop off your Bike\n",
        "and then lean on it. It looks so smooth!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0944_SC04_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "If you’re visiting Eterna, you need to\n",
        "get yourself a Bicycle and take a\\fride down the Cycling Road."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0944_SC04_00011",
      "en_US": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0944_SC04_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "They say this is an old city.\r",
        "It doesn’t look it, though.\n",
        "Not with all these tall buildings."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0944_SC04_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Eterna City’s not anything like it\n",
        "was before, way back in the day."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0944_SC04_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "They say this is a Pokémon that lived\n",
        "long, long ago."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0944_SC04_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, don’t tell me you don’t have\n",
        "an Explorer Kit?\r",
        "You should have a word with the man\n",
        "next door to the Pokémon Center.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0944_SC04_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, don’t tell me you don’t have\n",
        "an Explorer Kit?\r",
        "You should have a word with the man\n",
        "next door to the Pokémon Center."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0944_SC04_00017",
      "en_US": [
