        "Kit is a blast, isn’t it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0944_SC04_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, wow!\n",
        "You got a Bicycle!\r",
        "You can ride down Cycling Road\n",
        "and end up in Hearthome City.\r",
        "It’s a fast and fun ride.\n",
        "You should check it out!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0944_SC04_00019",
      "en_US": [
